# Top-Level RFID Tag Circuit

* Top-level instantiation of all blocks
* Process: 180nm CMOS
* Supply: VDD=3.3V, VSS=0V

VDD vdd 0 3.3
VSS vss 0 0

* Power-up reset
Vrst vdd 0 pwl(0s 0 10ns 1)
Rrst vdd 0 1k

* 13.56 MHz carrier source (reader)
Vcarrier ant_in gnd ac 1 0
*.ac DEC 10 1Meg 10Gig

* Antenna Interface
Xant_int antenna_interface ant_in ant_out vdd vss

* RF Front-End: 13.56MHz backscatter coupler, sub-carrier, ASK demodulation
Xrf_front rf_front_end ant_in ant_out vdd vss

* LDO Regulator (from rectifier output)
Xreg regulator ant_out vdd vss

* Crypto Core (LFSR lightweight - parameterizable)
Xcrypto crypto_core vdd vss rst_n

* State Machine & Anti-Collision
Xstate state_machine vdd vss rst_n \
    cmd_query=cmd_query cmd_select=cmd_select \
    resp_data=resp_data resp_valid=resp_valid \
    auth_pass=auth_pass dist_bound=dist_bound

* Backscatter Reader Link
Xreader reader_link vdd vss ant_in ant_out \
    resp_data=resp_data resp_valid=resp_valid \
    auth_pass=auth_pass

* Reader link subcircuit: backscatter modulation and reader communication
.SUBCKT reader_link vdd vss ant_in ant_out resp_data resp_valid auth_pass
* Placeholder: antenna input monitoring
Vant_mon ant_in vdd 0.5
* resp_data: derived from ant_out
XOR2_resp ant_out resp_data vdd vss XOR2
* resp_valid: high when signal present
Vresp_valid_sel resp_valid vdd vss 0
* auth_pass: tied low for placeholder
Vauth_passtie auth_pass vdd vss 0
.EN resp_data resp_valid auth_pass
.END

* Low-Power Clock
Vclk clk_32k 0 dc 0 pulse(0 1u 1u 0 1u 1u 256u)

Rload vdd vss 10k

* Monitoring
* Power current monitor
Ivdd vdd 0 0.001

.END